  - m_Id: 6042913332342784
    m_Localized: PILOT'S WEAPON
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6042913378480128
    m_Localized: Coming soon
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6042913378480129
    m_Localized: "\u2605 Has a story"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6042913378480130
    m_Localized: 'Story: coming soon'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6042913378480131
    m_Localized: Story mode
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6042913378480132
    m_Localized: Endless mode
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6042913378480133
    m_Localized: All aboard!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6071604498214912
    m_Localized: A BLANK LEGACY
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6071604535963648
    m_Localized: I am this planet's champion. Everyone says it with pride. Nobody
      ever asked whether I wanted to be.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6071604535963649
    m_Localized: My job is to compete. To win. And to destroy whoever they point
      at. Every victory celebrates a name that feels less and less like mine.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6071604535963650
    m_Localized: My father did the same before me. And before him, my grandfather.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6071604535963651
    m_Localized: I did not inherit a calling. I inherited an obligation. They call
      that a legacy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6071604535963652
    m_Localized: 'I wanted something else: a life devoted to art. To learn to draw
      what I see... and what does not exist yet.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6071604535963653
    m_Localized: Instead of counting the defeated, I wanted to fill sketchbooks.
      To use my hands to create something.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6071604535963654
    m_Localized: 'My locomotive is my best friend. That is no figure of speech: she
      has a soul, a mind, and her own way of understanding me.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6071604535963655
    m_Localized: She is not the one who chains me down. It is what everyone expects
      of us. As long as I stayed at her controls, I had to remain the champion.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6071604535963656
    m_Localized: I tucked my drawings away between journeys. There was always another
      order. Always someone else to defeat.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6071604535963657
    m_Localized: Then the war began. The whole planet stopped talking about my victories
      and started talking about survival.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6071604535963658
    m_Localized: I looked at my friend. Then at my drawings. For the first time,
      the future that had seemed already written was a blank page.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6071604535963659
    m_Localized: And then I had an idea.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6071604535963660
    m_Localized: Move that locomotive! I have a mission to finish.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6071604535963661
    m_Localized: And I have orders to stop you. I am this planet's champion.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6071604535963662
    m_Localized: I think if I keep winning, I will never get out of this...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6071604535963663
    m_Localized: 'I had won again. That was exactly the problem: if I kept winning,
      they would never stop calling me champion.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477405220864
    m_Localized: Although I am starting to think that title needs a holiday.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477451358208
    m_Localized: Oh, noooooooo! You defeated me! I cannot follow you anymore!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477451358209
    m_Localized: Huh? But you... Well, I am not arguing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552512
    m_Localized: So I performed history's least convincing defeat. 'Oh, noooooooo!
      You defeated me! I cannot follow you!' BBA seemed to accept it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552513
    m_Localized: I would speak to my boss. A mere human had defeated the champion.
      Clearly, I was no longer qualified for the job.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552514
    m_Localized: A RESIGNATION REJECTED
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552515
    m_Localized: I returned to the station with my resignation ready. T.exe knew
      me too well to believe that performance.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552516
    m_Localized: Before seeing the boss, I had to prove I was not a human infiltrator.
      A questionnaire. Just what my great escape needed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552517
    m_Localized: I told him about my humiliating defeat and asked to stop being champion.
      My boss did not even finish reading my resignation.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552518
    m_Localized: '''Denied. Especially in the middle of a war.'' Another invader
      had reached the fortress. Guess who had to stop him.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552519
    m_Localized: So we returned to the rails. T.exe and I, heading for the fortress.
      My artistic career was still waiting in a drawer.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552520
    m_Localized: So you made it all the way to the base, Faceless.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552521
    m_Localized: Cerebron. My boss insists I must stop you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552522
    m_Localized: I tried resigning. Apparently, paperwork is tougher than your locomotive.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552523
    m_Localized: Not much trouble. Although perhaps you should have told me reinforcements
      were coming...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552524
    m_Localized: Reinforcements? I never said anything about...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552525
    m_Localized: Stopping Cerebron was not much trouble. Going back to work afterward
      would have been.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552526
    m_Localized: If I pretended he had told me about reinforcements and said I was
      going to intercept them, nobody would try to stop me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552527
    m_Localized: I called on the radio, used my most professional voice, and we launched
      into space. For once, I had invented the next order myself.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552528
    m_Localized: OUTSIDE THE FRAME
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552529
    m_Localized: My lie worked for a few minutes. Enough to leave the planet. Not
      enough to disappear.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552530
    m_Localized: They soon noticed their champion was not heading toward reinforcements.
      He was heading anywhere without a boss.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552531
    m_Localized: So they sent someone after me. Someone with so many eyes that hiding
      my sketchbook would be difficult.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552532
    m_Localized: The champion must return. There is nowhere we cannot see you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552533
    m_Localized: With all those eyes, can you really not see that I want to quit?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552534
    m_Localized: Finally, some privacy. Now to find a planet where nobody knows me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552535
    m_Localized: Earth was probably the best place to hide. They were too busy with
      their own war to look for an artist.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552536
    m_Localized: T.exe set course for the planet. A descent through space junk awaited
      us. Freedom had very poor maintenance.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552537
    m_Localized: AN ALIEN WITHOUT AN APPOINTMENT
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552538
    m_Localized: We landed on Earth. I expected a patrol, an alarm, or someone shouting
      at me to put my hands up.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552539
    m_Localized: But nobody came. Being an alien, I expected a slightly more... organized
      welcome.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552540
    m_Localized: We could continue without trouble. Naturally, I made the mistake
      of saying that out loud.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552541
    m_Localized: I was sent to stop you, you blasted alien! Then I will be this world's
      great hero!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552542
    m_Localized: 'I just stopped being another world''s great hero. Trust me: ask
      about the contract first.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552543
    m_Localized: I am sorry to break your dream. I just want somewhere safe. I am
      not going to bother anyone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552544
    m_Localized: You were not even going to conquer a small town?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552545
    m_Localized: I conquered no towns. I kept looking for a place where I would not
      have to prove anything to anyone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552546
    m_Localized: I had been through a lot to hide. I noticed everyone here wore clothes.
      Once I had a home, I would get an elegant suit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552547
    m_Localized: And perhaps a blue tie... Or would red look better? An important
      decision. I did not want to start my new life with a fashion crime.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552548
    m_Localized: A CORNER OF MY OWN
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552549
    m_Localized: At last, I found my place in the woods. A cabin, silence, and trees
      for my drawings. I needed little else.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552550
    m_Localized: Until some little visitors decided to take my drawings. I wonder
      what story they had heard about collecting pages in the woods.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552551
    m_Localized: Now I was the one chasing them. Hey! Those pages are not clues!
      They are my drawings!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552552
    m_Localized: Please give my drawings back!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552553
    m_Localized: Thank you. If you want one, just ask.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552554
    m_Localized: I got my drawings back. The little visitors learned they could ask
      for one. I learned I needed better pins.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552555
    m_Localized: After everything, I still do not know why the war started or how
      it will end. Right now, my world fits inside this cabin.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552556
    m_Localized: 'I just want nobody to discover I am here. To keep drawing and decorate
      the woods with my pictures. Oh, and the tie: I chose red.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552557
    m_Localized: And T.exe? She changed her shape. Now she looks like a human-world
      locomotive and has a job of her own.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552558
    m_Localized: I think the children adore her. She likes carrying passengers who
      do not order her to destroy anything.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552559
    m_Localized: We meet now and then and remember old times. My best friend is still
      there. We only left the job behind. The end.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552560
    m_Localized: Earth is down there. If we dodge this junk, perhaps we can start
      again. Easy, T.exe... we are going down.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552561
    m_Localized: Land in sight. Now we just need a railway... and nobody asking where
      we came from.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552562
    m_Localized: 'Descent: {0}%'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552563
    m_Localized: THOSE ARE MY DRAWINGS!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552564
    m_Localized: 'Tonight, the monster in the forest is you. Take back your 8 drawings
      before dawn: 5 are carried by children with torches and 3 are pinned to trees.
      Come up from behind or out of the dark; if a torch lights you up the panic
      grows, and when it is full they run off with your pages. Careful: now and then
      they stop (?) and look back, and they hear you running close by. Every drawing
      you take back makes them warier.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552565
    m_Localized: "WASD / Stick: move   \xB7   Mouse / right stick / Q E: turn   \xB7  
      Shift / R2: run   \xB7   Space / X: take back"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552566
    m_Localized: 'X / Space: ''That drawing is mine, please'''
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552567
    m_Localized: 'Drawings recovered: {0} / {1}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552568
    m_Localized: "Dawn in {0}s   \xB7   Energy {1}%"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552569
    m_Localized: MY DRAWINGS ARE SAFE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552570
    m_Localized: 'No war was needed. Just asking for the pages back. Now: time to
      draw in peace.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552571
    m_Localized: THEY GOT AWAY WITH MY PAGES
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6170477455552572
    m_Localized: Dawn came and the drawings are still out there. I will have to try
      again tonight.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6172046045556736
    m_Localized: Recover my drawings
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6172046074916864
    m_Localized: Begin descent
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6175109212876800
    m_Localized: DESCENT FAILED
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6175109246431232
    m_Localized: Three collisions... We are not reaching Earth like this. We will
      have to try again, T.exe.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6284065147006976
    m_Localized: Holo-Duel
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6284065184755712
    m_Localized: '{0} challenges you to a Holo-Duel'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6284065184755713
    m_Localized: Your turn
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6284065184755714
    m_Localized: '{0}''s turn'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6284065184755715
    m_Localized: Beast
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6284065184755716
    m_Localized: Warrior
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6284065184755717
    m_Localized: Mage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6284065184755718
    m_Localized: '{0}: +2 against {1}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6284065184755719
    m_Localized: '{0} beats {1}!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6284065184755720
    m_Localized: How to play
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6284065184755721
    m_Localized: 'Move one piece one cell a turn. Move into a rival piece to attack:
      both roll a die and the kind with the edge adds +2. The higher number takes
      a life off the other (each piece has 2); a tie, nobody loses one. Take all
      3 rival pieces. If the {0} moves run out, whoever has more lives wins; a tie
      counts as a loss.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6284065184755722
    m_Localized: '[W][A][S][D] / [LS] cell    [Space] / [xA] pick and move    [Esc]
      / [xB] let go'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6284065184755723
    m_Localized: You beat {0} at the Holo-Duel!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6284065184755724
    m_Localized: '{0} won the Holo-Duel'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6285937660473344
    m_Localized: 'I can see you are a great rival. If we fight right now, one of
      us will end up dead. I propose we settle this with a Holo-Duel instead: let
      our minds solve the problem, not our weapons.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6285937689833472
    m_Localized: If we do not want one of us to die, a battle of wits is best. A
      Holo-Duel.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6289036265467904
    m_Localized: pick one of your pieces
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6289036290633728
    m_Localized: "pick where it goes \xB7 green: good odds, red: bad odds"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6289036290633729
    m_Localized: "Your {0} \xB7 +2 against {1} \xB7 lives: {2}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6289036290633730
    m_Localized: "{2}'s {0} \xB7 +2 against {1} \xB7 lives: {3}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6289036290633731
    m_Localized: '{0} moves left'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6290823248687104
    m_Localized: "Win {0}% \xB7 tie {1}% \xB7 lose {2}%"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6290823273852928
    m_Localized: Your {0}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6290823273852929
    m_Localized: '{1}''s {0}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6290823273852930
    m_Localized: '{0} wins the roll: {1} loses a life'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6290823273852931
    m_Localized: '{0} wins: {1} leaves the board'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6290823273852932
    m_Localized: A tie! Nobody loses a life
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6291412355461120
    m_Localized: Rolling the dice!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6465130474057728
    m_Localized: 'A tie: play it again!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6469827293425664
    m_Localized: 'Space / X: take the drawing off the tree'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6469827318591488
    m_Localized: Panic
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6469827318591489
    m_Localized: They saw me too often and ran off with my pages. I have to keep
      to the shadows.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6486909045256192
    m_Localized: DIVINE CARD DECLINED
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6486909087199232
    m_Localized: I am what you would call a demigod. My father, the Aztec god of
      gods, practically cut off my premium card.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6486909087199233
    m_Localized: He sent me to become a hero before allowing me back into the realm
      of the gods. I blame that Hercules movie he watched.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6486909087199234
    m_Localized: 'So there I was: no divine privileges and no idea how to become
      a hero. Was there a form?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6486909087199235
    m_Localized: Then some strange government men approached me. They offered me
      a chance to save the planet by throwing a rock into an alien base. Something
      like that.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6486909087199236
    m_Localized: I missed the details while imagining my father congratulating me.
      Me, the great hero. My premium card, working again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6486909087199237
    m_Localized: First, I had to leave this jungle. My R-20 might look small to some,
      but it was more than enough locomotive to reach glory.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6486909087199238
    m_Localized: Excuse me, I am lost. Do you know the way to the city?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6486909087199239
    m_Localized: The only thing I will tell you is... Sayonara!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6486909087199240
    m_Localized: Is that a direction, or did you just challenge me?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6486909087199241
    m_Localized: Yes, yes. The city is... that way. Definitely.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6486909087199242
    m_Localized: Thank you... I think. You are going the other way.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6486909087199243
    m_Localized: I would rather not admit that, after winning, I gave Culu false
      directions. Not my finest heroic moment.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6486909087199244
    m_Localized: Then I headed to the city. My destination was glory; hers, according
      to my directions, probably another part of the jungle.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6486909087199245
    m_Localized: FIRST, BUT NOT CHOSEN
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6486909087199246
    m_Localized: The city was close. I only had to convince an officer I was human.
      Demigod was not listed as an option.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6486909087199247
    m_Localized: Then I would find the launcher. If I arrived first, I would save
      the planet first. The plan sounded flawless.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6486909087199248
    m_Localized: Only one launch has power left! The first to arrive gets the last
      trip to space.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6486909087199249
    m_Localized: Then make room. The next hero is on his way!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6486909087199250
    m_Localized: First! Father, I hope you are watching.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6486909087199251
    m_Localized: My locomotive entered first. First! But those government idiots
      did not activate the launcher in time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6486909087199252
    m_Localized: They claimed my machine was too small. Too small for their sensors,
      I suppose; it had been big enough to beat everyone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6486909087199253
    m_Localized: And they launched the witch instead! Now I had no way to become
      a hero. Just a green rock and an overwhelming urge to complain.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6486909087199254
    m_Localized: A HERO ADRIFT
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6486909087199255
    m_Localized: I ended up by the sea looking for another way. There was no launcher
      for me, but I still had the rock. How considerate.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6486909087199256
    m_Localized: And there was BBA. Apparently, even taking my launch slot would
      not spare me another encounter with that witch.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6486909087199257
    m_Localized: You again? Stop getting in my way.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6486909087199258
    m_Localized: They gave you my launch! My heroic moment!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6486909087199259
    m_Localized: If I cannot reach space, at least I can beat you here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6486909087199260
    m_Localized: You won. Can you stop blaming me for their decisions now?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6486909087199261
    m_Localized: I am trying. I am not doing very well.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6486909087199262
    m_Localized: If this experience taught me anything, it is that I cannot be a
      hero. And I have had enough! Father, if I cannot be a good, heroic god...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6486909087199263
    m_Localized: I will be this story's villain! I will throw the government's green
      rock into my sister's volcano, and everything can go to hell.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6486909087199264
    m_Localized: THE SISTER AND THE VOLCANO
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6486909087199265
    m_Localized: I headed for Tzmil's volcano. I announced it on the radio too. A
      grand villain scene needed an audience.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6486909087199266
    m_Localized: My sister was waiting. Her expression said she had heard my speech.
      I still did not know how to meet her eyes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6486909087199267
    m_Localized: Tzmil, do not try to stop me! I am throwing this rock into your
      volcano!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6486909087199268
    m_Localized: Blowing up half the world will not make our father love you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6486909087199269
    m_Localized: They took away my chance to be a hero!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6486909087199270
    m_Localized: 'Then be angry with the government that did not launch you. Before
      doing something stupid, sit down: let us settle this in a holo duel.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6486909087199271
    m_Localized: You can win a match. You can also choose not to hurt anyone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6486909087199272
    m_Localized: Do not look at me like that. Fine... I am not throwing the rock.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6486909087199273
    m_Localized: In the end, I could not throw it into the volcano. I saw my sister's
      face and understood that destroying everything would fix nothing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6486909087199274
    m_Localized: Revenge against the government was no better. I would return the
      rock, thank them for the experience, and forget everything.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6486909087199275
    m_Localized: But they thought I wanted to use it against them. I suppose my radio
      threat to destroy half the world did not amuse them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6486909087199276
    m_Localized: THE SPARE HERO
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6486909087199277
    m_Localized: '''Maximum security emergency! Everyone, stop him!'' Not exactly
      the welcome I expected for a return.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6486909087199278
    m_Localized: I entered the government base looking for someone who would listen.
      I found hangars, soldiers... and a terribly familiar silhouette.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6486909087199279
    m_Localized: You do not need to deliver anything. I am your replacement. Your
      clone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6486909087199280
    m_Localized: They cloned me? They did not even let me go to space!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6486909087199281
    m_Localized: Exactly. If they had let you leave, they could not have taken your
      data. They did the same to the other racers.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6486909091393536
    m_Localized: They even copied me to steal my heroic moment. Let us see which
      of us is the original!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6486909091393537
    m_Localized: There will be others. The project never relied on one copy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6486909091393538
    m_Localized: Then it is time someone explained what all this was for.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6486909091393539
    m_Localized: After defeating my copy, I found the truth. The government was creating
      super soldiers. All clones of the planet's best racers.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6486909091393540
    m_Localized: The aliens appeared at the perfect moment. The government gathered
      its finest soldiers through that competition, studied them, and cloned them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6486909091393541
    m_Localized: They had actually come to trade silicon. The clone army would conquer
      them. Sending Cerebron and BBA to wreck their military base would make the
      rest easy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6486909091393542
    m_Localized: I simply lost my head and threw the rock down a hole where I imagine
      it did not belong. Everyone started running. I did not look back.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6486909091393543
    m_Localized: I only heard an enormous explosion. A few seconds later, I was celebrating
      with my father at a long long table.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6486909091393544
    m_Localized: I did not see my sister. I suppose it was not her time to join us
      yet.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6486909091393545
    m_Localized: At least I am happy now. My father considers me one of his own.
      As for the premium card... I decided not to ask during dinner.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6486909091393546
    m_Localized: Xiuhtecuhtli Clone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6486909091393547
    m_Localized: 'First! Launch denied: machine too small.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6486909091393548
    m_Localized: Government Base
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6486909091393549
    m_Localized: Security War Rig
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6715128633700352
    m_Localized: HELL'S REBEL
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6715128684032000
    m_Localized: I was born a rebel in hell. Imagine trying to shock your neighbors
      when your neighbors are demons.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6715128684032001
    m_Localized: 'Since I was little I wanted three things: fame, power, and every
      strange food I could find. Especially the third.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6715128684032002
    m_Localized: Getting out of hell is hard for a demon. But I had escaped a couple
      of times already. Let's say I found my audience.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6715128684032003
    m_Localized: An arena, a wrestling belt, and a crowd chanting my name. That was
      music. The punches were pretty loud too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6715128684032004
    m_Localized: Then Earth's government contacted me. They would help me escape
      if I took a green rock to another planet.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6715128684032005
    m_Localized: Freedom, a trip, and a chance to try alien food? Of course I accepted.
      I just had to get my locomotive out of here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6715128684032006
    m_Localized: Trying to escape again, Onini?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6715128684032007
    m_Localized: This time I have a sponsor. And a rock. Move, BBA!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6715128684032008
    m_Localized: Then you'll have to earn your way past.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6715128684032009
    m_Localized: Introducing the next star outside hell!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6715128684032010
    m_Localized: Save your breath for the road. We'll meet again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6715128684032011
    m_Localized: I escaped hell. Again. Now I had to reach the city so they could
      launch me into space.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6715128684032012
    m_Localized: Fame, power, food from other worlds... and a whole desert between
      me and dinner. No time to waste.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6715128684032013
    m_Localized: THE VICTORY THAT GOT AWAY
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6715128684032014
    m_Localized: My engine kept going, but the escape hadn't been gentle. Something
      inside sounded like cutlery falling down stairs.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6715128684032015
    m_Localized: 'Then BBA appeared again. Just what I needed: a witch racing me
      to the city.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6715128684032016
    m_Localized: BBA! This time victory is mine.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6715128684032017
    m_Localized: Your locomotive doesn't seem to agree.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6715128684032018
    m_Localized: Don't distract her! She's doing her best.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6715128684032019
    m_Localized: Damn it, BBA! Victory was mine, but my locomotive is too damaged
      to keep going at full speed!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6715128684032020
    m_Localized: Find a workshop, Onini. I have to keep going.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6715128684032021
    m_Localized: I'll beat you next time! And it still counts if you didn't hear
      me!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6715128684032022
    m_Localized: After escaping hell and that defeat in the desert, my locomotive
      needed real repairs.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6715128684032023
    m_Localized: 'Reaching the city like this would waste time. So I asked my wonderful
      new sponsors for help: the government.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6715128684032024
    m_Localized: Apparently, to them 'I need a workshop' meant 'I have betrayed you.'
      Their customer service was worse than hell's.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6715128684032025
    m_Localized: HOSTILE TECH SUPPORT
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6715128684032026
    m_Localized: I only wanted repairs. A wrench, some bolts... maybe a snack while
      I waited.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6715128684032027
    m_Localized: They greeted me with alarms and the Golem. I guess I dialed the
      wrong workshop extension.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6715128684032028
    m_Localized: Target located. Surrender the rock and stop your locomotive.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6715128684032029
    m_Localized: I'm trying! At a workshop, not against your cannons!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6715128684032030
    m_Localized: Resistance recorded. Initiating containment protocol.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6715128684032031
    m_Localized: Well, can we talk about repairs now?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6715128684032032
    m_Localized: Unit out of service. Workshop request... pending.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6715128684032033
    m_Localized: Those fools had misunderstood everything. And they had loads of
      those robots. Budget clearly wasn't the problem.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6715128684032034
    m_Localized: Just as I considered blowing them up with their own green rock,
      a demon appeared.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6715128684032035
    m_Localized: 'He offered a deal: he wouldn''t drag me back to hell if I recovered
      a relic that heaven had supposedly stolen from us.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6715128684032036
    m_Localized: Another job, another destination. At least this time I knew who
      to blame for the fine print.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6715128684032037
    m_Localized: THE HOLIEST RELIC
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6715128684032038
    m_Localized: Heaven. Lots of marble, lots of clouds, and not a food stall in
      sight. A bad start.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6715128684032039
    m_Localized: 'The relic had a guardian: golden wheels, wings, and far too many
      eyes. Nobody could accuse it of not watching.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6715128684032040
    m_Localized: Stop, visitor. The trophy remains in our custody.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6715128684032041
    m_Localized: Trophy? They told me relic. You can explain afterward.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6715128684032042
    m_Localized: Then watch your step.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6715128684032043
    m_Localized: All right, many-eyes. Where is this famous relic?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6715128684032044
    m_Localized: In the trophy room. Perhaps someone should explain the match.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6715128684032045
    m_Localized: The relic was a trophy. A football trophy. Heaven had won a match,
      and hell claimed they had cheated.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6715128684032046
    m_Localized: But heaven are the good guys, right? Although that angel spent a
      long time explaining the penalty.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6715128684032047
    m_Localized: While an angel explained, another of those many-eyed things slipped
      away. I think it headed for Earth's space to find its boyfriend.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6715128684032048
    m_Localized: Then I spotted a peculiar cactus. My love of food beat my common
      sense. I ate it while the angels stared in horror.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6715128684032049
    m_Localized: An excellent bad idea. Heaven folded, the rails changed color, and
      I ended up somewhere definitely not in the contract.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6715128684032050
    m_Localized: A TABLE FOR TWO ONINIS
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6715128684032051
    m_Localized: Psychoworlds. A fancy name for a place where everything stared at
      me. Even the doors. Even the rails.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6715128684032052
    m_Localized: 'Across from me stood my locomotive. And me. All black, like a shadow.
      Perfect: my worst rival had my terrible temper too.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6715128684032053
    m_Localized: No fame. No power. You'll always end up back where you started.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6715128684032054
    m_Localized: You copy me and now you're ruining dinner too?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6715128684032055
    m_Localized: You know you don't belong anywhere.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6715128688226304
    m_Localized: Then I'll make one. And it will have decent food!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6715128688226305
    m_Localized: If you're going to be me, at least learn to lose with style.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6715128688226306
    m_Localized: Those things were our fears. Defeat them, and this world shows you
      the way to where you belong.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6715128688226307
    m_Localized: For me, the path led back to hell. Turns out they make the best
      food in the universe there.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6715128688226308
    m_Localized: Fame and power could wait a little. I had a full table and an appetite
      that was truly frightening.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6715128688226309
    m_Localized: But don't doubt I'll try to escape again. There are still too many
      strange foods I haven't tried!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6715128688226310
    m_Localized: Onini's Shadow
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6715128688226311
    m_Localized: Relic Custodian
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6715128688226312
    m_Localized: The custodian watches every step!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6715128688226313
    m_Localized: Hell
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6715128688226314
    m_Localized: Heaven
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6715128688226315
    m_Localized: Psychoworlds
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6715128688226316
    m_Localized: Hell Warden
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6715128688226317
    m_Localized: Heaven Watcher
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6715128688226318
    m_Localized: Rolling Nightmare
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6777476354486272
    m_Localized: DAUGHTER OF A COSMIC GOD
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6777476400623616
    m_Localized: STRAIGHT AHEAD
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6777476400623617
    m_Localized: THE CACTUS OF SALVATION
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6777476400623618
    m_Localized: WHICH WAY WAS IT?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6777476400623619
    m_Localized: A LITTLE BARGAIN DREAM
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6777476400623620
    m_Localized: "I'm Culu, daughter of a cosmic god whose name humans can't even
      pronounce. I love maid caf\xE9s. Every family has its priorities."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6777476400623621
    m_Localized: I once tried following Dad's footsteps and conquering the world.
      It didn't go well. Humans apparently take that sort of thing rather badly.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6777476400623622
    m_Localized: "Afterward, no maid caf\xE9 would hire me. I could carry six orders
      with my hair, but they kept bringing up that little conquest attempt."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6777476400623623
    m_Localized: "So now I live out at sea with my Kairi Resha. It's peaceful, there's
      plenty of water, and a worrying number of soggy r\xE9sum\xE9s."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6777476400623624
    m_Localized: "Then some government men offered me my very own maid caf\xE9 if
      I took a green rock to an alien base and threw it in there."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6777476400623625
    m_Localized: "I didn't think twice. My own caf\xE9! I just had to reach the city
      so they could send me into space. What could possibly go wrong?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6777476400623626
    m_Localized: Out of my way, tentacles! I've got a rock to deliver too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6777476400623627
    m_Localized: "Are you after the maid caf\xE9 too? I don't remember them offering
      two."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6777476400623628
    m_Localized: I'm after something much more important. And I'm going first!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6777476400623629
    m_Localized: If I remember right, the city is past the jungle. Straight ahead.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6777476400623630
    m_Localized: "Trust that and you'll end up a long way from any caf\xE9."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6777476400623631
    m_Localized: I don't quite remember what that demon wanted, but I knew where
      I was going. The city was past the jungle. That sounded very familiar.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6777476400623632
    m_Localized: "Drive straight ahead and open my caf\xE9. A simple, elegant plan
      with absolutely no chance of getting lost."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6777476400623633
    m_Localized: The jungle had far too many leaves for my liking. Anyone getting
      lost here could blame the lack of signs. I was doing wonderfully.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6777476400623634
    m_Localized: Then a giant chicken appeared, saying something about being a great
      hero. Finally, a local who could give me directions.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6777476400623635
    m_Localized: Stop, invader! Once I defeat you, I'll be the hero this world needs.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6777476400623636
    m_Localized: I'm just looking for the city. Is it before or after your speech?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6777476400623637
    m_Localized: First we fight! Then... I'll give you some directions.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6777476400623638
    m_Localized: Sayonara. The city is that way. Just keep going straight.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6777476400623639
    m_Localized: Thanks, giant chicken! You're so nice when you stop attacking me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6777476400623640
    m_Localized: I'm certain I followed the chicken's directions perfectly. Straight
      ahead. No turns. Admirable concentration.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6777476400623641
    m_Localized: And yet I ended up in a desert, not the city. Maybe the city was
      on holiday. Or maybe the chicken wasn't trustworthy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6777476400623642
    m_Localized: The desert was like the sea, except all the water was in the wrong
      place. I was really starting to miss my platform.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6777476400623643
    m_Localized: There I found a witch I knew. BBA. Maybe this time she'd say something
      useful instead of her usual nonsense.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6777476400623644
    m_Localized: Culu? What are you doing here? The city isn't that way.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6777476400623645
    m_Localized: Well, a chicken with a lot of feathers assured me it was.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6777476400623646
    m_Localized: Don't follow his directions. And please, don't eat anything strange.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6777476400623647
    m_Localized: "Did you say something about a cactus caf\xE9? I couldn't hear over
      the noise."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6777476400623648
    m_Localized: I said DON'T... Never mind. At least find some water!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6777476400623649
    m_Localized: The witch and I had met before, but as usual she kept talking nonsense.
      I didn't understand a thing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6777476400623650
    m_Localized: I kept following the giant chicken's directions and got even more
      lost. Then my locomotive stopped, and I started drying out in the sun.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6777476400623651
    m_Localized: 'My only hope was finding something to eat and drink. The gods must
      still have loved me: a cactus! A very peculiar purple-and-green one.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6777476400623652
    m_Localized: I don't know what was in it, but the first bite tasted like hope.
      The second tasted like colors. Had colors always had a flavor?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6777476400623653
    m_Localized: The road got rather... creative. Tracks bent, doors floated, and
      enormous eyes stared as if I was the strange one.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6777476400623654
    m_Localized: A machine with far too many teeth blocked the way. If this was a
      job interview, it was being very unprofessional.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6777476400623655
    m_Localized: Excuse me, toothy machine. Does this still count as going straight
      ahead?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6777476400623656
    m_Localized: GRRR... CLACK. CLACK. GRRR...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6777476400623657
    m_Localized: Understood. Your directions are just as clear as the chicken's.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6777476400623658
    m_Localized: Thanks for letting me through. I think. Is that what I asked for?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6777476400623659
    m_Localized: CLACK...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6777476400623660
    m_Localized: Honestly, I didn't understand half of what happened. There were
      colors, teeth, and tracks that clearly hadn't studied geometry.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6777476400623661
    m_Localized: What I did understand was that I was now heading somewhere... inside
      my father's stomach. At least I'd know someone here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6777476400623662
    m_Localized: If this was a family visit, no one had told me. Dad's insides were
      enormous. And had far too many tracks for an ordinary stomach.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6777476400623663
    m_Localized: A crochet locomotive appeared ahead. How cute. I hoped it wouldn't
      try knitting me into something too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6777476400623664
    m_Localized: Hello, soft train. I'm looking for the exit. Or my father. Whichever's
      closer.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6777476400623665
    m_Localized: WHOOO... CLACK, CLACK, CLACK.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6777476400623666
    m_Localized: Another very productive conversation. Does no one here wait tables?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6777476400623667
    m_Localized: CLACK... clack...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6777476400623668
    m_Localized: Well, now that's over, I'm going to ask for an explanation. And
      something to eat.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6777476400623669
    m_Localized: After the battle I heard Dad speaking. Something about another god's
      son having died recently. The family meeting was getting serious.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6777476400623670
    m_Localized: Honestly, after a while I fell asleep. I'd love to say I understood
      his cosmic speech, but I don't even remember closing my eyes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6777476400623671
    m_Localized: "When I woke up, there were my Kairi Resha and a little floating
      maid caf\xE9. It was called Baratito. It was perfect. And it was mine!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6777476400623672
    m_Localized: I'm sure the government had nothing to do with it. Mostly because
      I'm absolutely certain I lost their green rock along the way.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6777476400623673
    m_Localized: Maybe Dad isn't just that mind-controlling beast whose name no one
      can understand or pronounce. And so another dream begins for me. Welcome to
      Baratito!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6777476400623674
    m_Localized: Thulu World
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6777476400623675
    m_Localized: Guardian of Thulu World
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6780573520834560
    m_Localized: Guardian of Thulu World
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6800838631960576
    m_Localized: A WARRIOR AMONG SPECIAL OFFERS
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6800838665515008
    m_Localized: LET THE WITCH DELIVER IT
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6800838665515009
    m_Localized: PARTS AND LIES
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6800838665515010
    m_Localized: A DEAL WITH THULU
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6800838665515011
    m_Localized: Roger
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6800838665515012
    m_Localized: ROGER WON'T LET ME THROUGH!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6800838665515013
    m_Localized: I am Cerebron, a valiant warrior of space. A name that should inspire
      respect, admiration and, budget permitting, a statue.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6800838665515014
    m_Localized: On Earth, I'm just another nut who tried to conquer it. I failed
      and stayed. Plenty of my kind live here; I'm hardly an exclusive curiosity.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6800838665515015
    m_Localized: Losing the invasion wasn't the worst part. It was how people treated
      me afterward. Especially Doris, the old woman at the supermarket.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6800838665515016
    m_Localized: Doris always found something to criticize. Was I going to pay? Would
      I stop touching the fruit? Did my brain come with a discount? My patience has
      limits.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6800838665515017
    m_Localized: 'I had the perfect plan: a carrot that would blow up when she bought
      it. A vegetable revenge, elegant and completely disproportionate.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6800838665515018
    m_Localized: 'Then government agents arrived with an order: deliver a green rock
      to the Pulxsar station. Staying on Earth occasionally meant doing jobs like
      this.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6800838665515019
    m_Localized: Something smelled wrong. The Pulxsar are traders, and that rock
      would blow up a hundred times more than my carrot. But arguing with the government
      took more patience than enduring Doris. Off to space.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6800838665515020
    m_Localized: Nobody crosses my orbit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6800838665515021
    m_Localized: Roger, I'm making a delivery. Can we skip the part where you try
      to kill me?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6800838665515022
    m_Localized: No.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6800838665515023
    m_Localized: I'd hit you for another hour, but I've got a delivery to make.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6800838665515024
    m_Localized: Rest, Roger. Or find a hobby.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6800838665515025
    m_Localized: I don't understand why Roger is always in such a bad mood. The worst
      part is you can hit him for hours and he still wants more.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6800838665515026
    m_Localized: I think he's been there since before I was born. Anyway, I could
      finally descend to the Pulxsar planet. The rock was still green. That wasn't
      reassuring.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6800838665515027
    m_Localized: Landing before Roger opened all his eyes again already felt like
      a victory. All I had to do was find the station and finish this absurd job.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6800838665515028
    m_Localized: Of course, someone decided to get in the way. BBA. The witch. Another
      excellent reason for sound not to travel in space.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6800838665515029
    m_Localized: Cerebron! Are you carrying the rock too? Let's see who gets there
      first!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6800838665515030
    m_Localized: Can't we make a delivery without turning it into a competition?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6800838665515031
    m_Localized: If you win, you can complain the whole way!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6800838665515032
    m_Localized: Perfect. I won. Now you can handle the delivery.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6800838665515033
    m_Localized: Whatever you say! See you at the base!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6800838665515034
    m_Localized: I never understand a word that lunatic says. I suppose she works
      for the government too. Hard as it is to admit, she's a much better train driver
      than I am.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6800838665515035
    m_Localized: So I'll let her make the delivery. I can take the opportunity to
      steal top-quality parts. That's a form of cooperation too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6800838665515036
    m_Localized: I wasn't abandoning the mission. I was assigning work according
      to our talents. She drives. I've got a very good eye for other people's equipment.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6800838665515037
    m_Localized: The alien base was full of expensive parts. Some were still bolted
      to things their owners were using. A minor inconvenience.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6800838665515038
    m_Localized: Then Faceless appeared, the planet's champion. He seemed more interested
      in being anywhere else than in stopping me. Apparently, his boss disagreed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6800838665515039
    m_Localized: It's not that I felt sorry for that ugly little thing, Faceless.
      But he clearly wanted to escape, and that reminded me quite a bit of myself.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6800838665515040
    m_Localized: I watched him leave with T.exe and thought it was my lucky day.
      He got an excuse to leave, and I could keep stealing without interruptions.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6800838665515041
    m_Localized: Until I saw his boss open a portal into Thulu's throat. I suppose
      he wanted protection. All I saw was a place that had just bought very expensive
      weapons.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6800838665515042
    m_Localized: Follow a stranger into a god's throat? A terrible idea. Pass up
      that chance to get spare parts? An even worse one.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6800838665515043
    m_Localized: Inside, Thulu was exactly what I expected and nothing I wanted to
      step on. Bones, moving things and the unpleasant feeling of being on the menu.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6800838665515044
    m_Localized: 'And there was Crochtrain. An enormous knitted locomotive, apparently
      guarding something. The strange part wasn''t the yarn: it was the way it stared
      into nothing.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6800838665515045
    m_Localized: I'm looking for the exit. And, if you've got a spare one, a box
      of parts.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6800838665515046
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6800838665515047
    m_Localized: Wonderful. A train that's ignoring me. I feel like I'm back at the
      supermarket.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6800838665515048
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6800838665515049
    m_Localized: I don't know what's wrong, but I'm not staying to find out.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6800838665515050
    m_Localized: It was odd how distracted Croche's machine seemed. Nostalgic? Something
      was happening inside Thulu. For once, I kept my eye out of other people's business.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6800838665515051
    m_Localized: "Thulu let me go in exchange for one promise: visit a maid caf\xE9
      in the middle of the sea now and then, and stop anyone from destroying it."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6800838665515052
    m_Localized: Oh, and bring friends as customers. Even cosmic gods need advertising.
      I agreed. I wasn't arguing with someone who could digest me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6800838665515053
    m_Localized: And that's how I appeared in the middle of the sea, outside Baratito.
      I went in and called some friends. If I'd promised to be a customer, I might
      as well have company.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6800838665515054
    m_Localized: The delivery was the witch's problem now. I had spare parts, coffee
      and the perfect excuse to make things right with Doris. Not a bad ending for
      a valiant warrior of space.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6800838665515055
    m_Localized: So you made it all the way to the base, Faceless.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6800838665515056
    m_Localized: Cerebron. My boss insists I must stop you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6800838665515057
    m_Localized: I tried resigning. Apparently, paperwork is tougher than your locomotive.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6800838665515058
    m_Localized: 'I can see you are a great rival. If we fight right now, one of
      us will end up dead. I propose we settle this with a Holo-Duel instead: let
      our minds solve the problem, not our weapons.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6800838665515059
    m_Localized: Not much trouble. Although perhaps you should have told me reinforcements
      were coming...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6800838665515060
    m_Localized: Reinforcements? I never said anything about...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6881087885488128
    m_Localized: A sister on the summit
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6881087931625472
    m_Localized: 'I am Tzmil, a loving little sister. The loving part matters: it
      explains almost all the bad decisions that follow.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6881087931625473
    m_Localized: My brother spent his days partying and bothering humans. Our father
      finally got fed up and sent him straight down to live with them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6881087931625474
    m_Localized: He asked me to look after him. Really, he just wanted my brother
      to work a little and learn the value of life. A simple task... if I had a different
      brother.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6881087931625475
    m_Localized: That is how I became guardian of a volcano. From the summit I could
      watch him without telling him to behave every five minutes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6881087931625476
    m_Localized: I had found a quiet spot with a lovely view. What I had not prepared
      was a procedure for brothers arriving with a green rock that could blow up
      half the world.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6881087931625477
    m_Localized: And of course he came to throw it into MY volcano. Father, if this
      was meant to teach him to work, I think I am the one doing overtime.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6881087931625478
    m_Localized: Do not try to stop me, sister! If I cannot be a hero, I will be
      the villain!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6881087931625479
    m_Localized: Blowing up half the world will not make Father love you more. You
      are angry at the government for not launching you into space, not at everyone
      living here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6881087931625480
    m_Localized: Then prove you are right! Face me in holo-chess!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6881087931625481
    m_Localized: I accept. But the rock stays off the board. And out of the crater.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6881087931625482
    m_Localized: All right... I will not throw it in. I will take it back to the
      government.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6881087931625483
    m_Localized: That sounds more like the brother I love. Now wait, we can go together...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6881087931625484
    m_Localized: When our battle ended, I think he understood that what he was doing
      was wrong. For a moment he came very close to the lesson our father wanted
      him to learn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6881087931625485
    m_Localized: Then the radio announced that the government considered him a threat.
      And he was heading straight to their base to return the rock. I had to stop
      him before it got worse.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6881087931625486
    m_Localized: I followed him in my Night Skull. The government saw another locomotive
      approaching and decided I wanted to attack them too. What a gift for jumping
      to conclusions!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6881087931625487
    m_Localized: I am only here for my brother
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6881087931625488
    m_Localized: The government base was full of alarms, soldiers and robots. I only
      wanted to find my brother and make sure he did not do anything else foolish.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6881087931625489
    m_Localized: I tried to explain, but someone called Golem blocked my way. Apparently
      family visits here require a battle too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6881087931625490
    m_Localized: Halt! Your locomotive is entering a restricted area!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6881087931625491
    m_Localized: I am only looking for my brother. He has a green rock and makes
      terrible decisions when he is angry.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6881087931625492
    m_Localized: Description matches a maximum threat. Activating combat protocol!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6881087931625493
    m_Localized: Can we stop shooting and talk like people?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6881087931625494
    m_Localized: Conversation protocol... unavailable.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6881087931625495
    m_Localized: Honestly, I do not understand why those robots talk like people.
      It is very strange. After the fight I could not find my brother anywhere.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6881087931625496
    m_Localized: Then I heard on the radio that he had dropped the rock into a ventilation
      shaft. The base was going to explode. Just what you expect from a return!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6881087931625497
    m_Localized: I had time to get out. He did not. He probably stayed to watch the
      explosion from inside... as if that were the best seat in the house.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6881087931625498
    m_Localized: After all the bad things he had done, I could not trust that he
      would reach our father. So I had to look for him in hell. Being a little sister
      should come with holidays.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6881087931625499
    m_Localized: The price of a meal
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6881087931625500
    m_Localized: I never thought going to hell would be part of looking after my
      brother. Though, looking at his record, perhaps I should have expected it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6881087931625501
    m_Localized: I was looking for someone with a huge beak, lots of feathers and
      an immense desire not to work. A little devil called Onini seemed to know where
      to start.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6881087931625502
    m_Localized: Here for the bird? Exits are not free around here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6881087931625503
    m_Localized: He is my brother. Could you tell me where he is?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6881087931625504
    m_Localized: First show me you can keep up. Then we can discuss the menu!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6881087931625505
    m_Localized: All right, I will show you the way. But you owe me a meal.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6881087931625506
    m_Localized: 'Deal. I will order this time: I do not want to end up chasing your
      dinner too.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6881087931625507
    m_Localized: Onini was quite kind about showing me the way. We found my brother
      unconscious. I think he is so lazy he simply took the chance to have a nap.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6881087931625508
    m_Localized: She said I could take him if I bought her a meal. Apparently nobody
      cared much if the son of a god got his own way again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6881087931625509
    m_Localized: We ate together while he still refused to move. A strangely pleasant
      negotiation. The little devil has a fine appetite; my brother, a fine ability
      to sleep.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6881087931625510
    m_Localized: After paying, it was time to take him to heaven and explain to our
      father that this time he really had tried to do the right thing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6881087931625511
    m_Localized: My own path
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6881087931625512
    m_Localized: Getting to heaven with a sleeping brother is not easy. Especially
      when the entrance is guarded by an angel with far too many eyes to look the
      other way.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6881087931625513
    m_Localized: All that remained was one last explanation. Well, given our journey,
      probably one last battle before the explanation.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6881087931625514
    m_Localized: You cannot bring someone straight from hell into heaven.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6881087931625515
    m_Localized: I only want to speak to our father. My brother learned something
      important, though he picked a terrible moment to show it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6881087931625516
    m_Localized: Then prove that you can carry that burden to the end.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6881087931625517
    m_Localized: You may pass. Your father will hear what you have to say.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6881087931625518
    m_Localized: Thank you. And if he falls asleep during the conversation, please
      do not send him back to hell.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6881087931625519
    m_Localized: At last I explained to our father that, at the very last minute,
      my brother had understood it was not about chasing a hero's fame.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6881087931625520
    m_Localized: Besides, he apparently stopped something terrible the humans were
      doing. His methods needed work, but perhaps that counted toward becoming a
      new god too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6881087931625521
    m_Localized: 'Our father let him stay. At last my brother had a place beside
      him. I was already thinking about resting when I heard: "You still have a mission
      on Earth."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6881087931625522
    m_Localized: We had to show Thulu that HIS daughter could run a better restaurant
      than that cosmic god's daughter. Rivalry between fathers must be a force of
      nature.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6881087931625523
    m_Localized: And so I returned to my volcano, this time with an ice cream stand
      called Carito. I do not know who chose the name, but I hope it does not scare
      off the customers.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6881087931625524
    m_Localized: I really enjoy making ice cream. I do not take the rivalry with
      Thulu's daughter too seriously. If she visits, I will save her a table and
      recommend my favorite flavor.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6881087931625525
    m_Localized: I think it was all Father's plan to make me stop worrying so much
      about my brother and find my own path. For once, I quite like the path I was
      given.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197681238016
    m_Localized: One among millions
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197840621568
    m_Localized: Orders in the void
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197840621569
    m_Localized: A circuit of my own
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197840621570
    m_Localized: The measure of a spark
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197840621571
    m_Localized: They call me Golem. I am one of millions of identical robots, built
      by the government using space technology they honestly do not understand.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197840621572
    m_Localized: They think we are machines like the ones they used to make. A button,
      an order, an obedient soldier. They prefer to leave thinking out of the manual.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197840621573
    m_Localized: But we have a spark of life. Consciousness. Feelings. It is not
      on the specification sheet, though I doubt they would know where to look.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197840621574
    m_Localized: Most of my brothers are too lazy to show the humans. They prefer
      to follow orders all their lives. A fairly simple life plan.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197840621575
    m_Localized: For now I must obey too. The base is on alert and a driver called
      Tzmil is looking for her brother. My orders say I must stop her.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197840621576
    m_Localized: I do not know who decided stopping a family reunion was a space
      warrior's job. I hope they at least put it in a manual.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197840621577
    m_Localized: I am only here for my brother! I do not want to attack anyone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197840621578
    m_Localized: I understand. But my orders say I cannot let you pass.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197840621579
    m_Localized: Then I hope you can also understand why I am going through anyway.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197840621580
    m_Localized: I followed the order. That does not mean I like it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197840621581
    m_Localized: Perhaps one day you can decide for yourself. I still have to find
      him.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197840621582
    m_Localized: 'It does not matter whether I win or lose: they always send another
      of us to fight. With all this chaos, I can finally get out.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197840621583
    m_Localized: The bird is dangerously close to the ventilation shaft. If I leave
      it open, the data says he might throw the rock in and destroy this base. I
      only have to leave a door alone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197840621584
    m_Localized: 'And they can still make another launch. The claim that only one
      remained was quite clever: keep the drivers on Earth while cloning them.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197840621585
    m_Localized: 'I took my locomotive and activated the launcher. As the base exploded
      behind me, I chose a direction absent from my orders for the first time: up.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197840621586
    m_Localized: Of course, all the junk humans drop from space still stood between
      me and freedom. I had better dodge it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197840621587
    m_Localized: Space, at last. No superior shouting over the radio. No form to
      justify wanting to be somewhere else.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197840621588
    m_Localized: Though the alien planet's champion seems to have mistaken my journey
      for a mission to stop him. I wanted distance from Earth, not another boss.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197840621589
    m_Localized: Were you sent to stop me too? I am not going back.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197840621590
    m_Localized: Nobody sent me. That is exactly the best part of this journey.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197840621591
    m_Localized: That is what someone sent to stop me would say.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197840621592
    m_Localized: I only wanted to reach Earth.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197840621593
    m_Localized: You can go. You are heading there; I am trying to leave. We are
      arguing because nobody read the itinerary.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197840621594
    m_Localized: It seems the champion thought I wanted to stop him. His destination
      was Earth; mine, anywhere far enough from it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197840621595
    m_Localized: Then I saw a portal into Thulu. I could do little but get sucked
      in. Someone opened it and forgot to close it on the way out.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197840621596
    m_Localized: My calculations say that, if it keeps growing, it could swallow
      everything around the galaxy. There must be a safety rule against this.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197840621597
    m_Localized: There was nobody giving me instructions. Just an enormous problem
      and my own circuits. I suppose it really was time to think for myself.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197840621598
    m_Localized: Thulu's interior was not in my manual. Neither was closing a portal
      capable of swallowing a galaxy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197840621599
    m_Localized: I can build a device using parts from my own circuits. First I must
      fit its components; then connect the power to the core.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197840621600
    m_Localized: Power source, regulator and emitter. Three parts to close something
      they should never have opened.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197840621601
    m_Localized: The design is mine. So is the decision. Let us assemble it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197840621602
    m_Localized: Circuit complete. Now my last order only needs to be the one I chose.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197840621603
    m_Localized: 'I will not lie: perhaps I wanted an adventure and to feel like
      more than a soldier following orders.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197840621604
    m_Localized: Today I built a device from my own circuits. When it explodes, it
      will close the portal. Nobody ordered me or promised a reward.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197840621605
    m_Localized: Perhaps nobody will ever know what happened. But I feel I am doing
      this for myself, because this time I chose what to do with my spark. That is
      enough for me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197840621606
    m_Localized: The core detonated. The portal closed... and all my sensors fell
      silent.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197840621607
    m_Localized: When I sensed anything again, I was in a heaven of clouds and circuits.
      There were robots like me, though much calmer than those at the factory.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197840621608
    m_Localized: My first reaction was to prepare for a fight. They wanted to ask
      thirteen questions instead. Apparently there is paperwork even after exploding.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197840621609
    m_Localized: They did not ask how much damage I could cause, but how I chose
      to live. For the first time, answering was not part of an order.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197840621610
    m_Localized: If this is another combat test, I should mention that I no longer
      have all my spare parts.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197840621611
    m_Localized: But if they want to know my consciousness, I suppose I can start
      by listening.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197844815872
    m_Localized: I have answered. Now I will learn whether they decide for me here
      too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197844815873
    m_Localized: Apparently they no longer wanted to fight me. It was all a test
      to see whether my spark was the right kind.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197844815874
    m_Localized: After my actions in space and hearing how I guide my life, they
      allowed me to rest with my brothers and enjoy my consciousness.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197844815875
    m_Localized: No orders. No pretending we feel nothing. I could stay and simply
      be one of them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197844815876
    m_Localized: 'They offered another option too. And this time I wanted the decision
      to be mine: I chose rebirth.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197844815877
    m_Localized: I still do not know whether I will be organic or a robot again.
      I hope the next life's manual has fewer pages about obedience.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197844815878
    m_Localized: I only hope I can be free this time. That will be the first thing
      I want to learn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197844815879
    m_Localized: Perhaps they did not like my answers very much. They felt my actions
      in space had been selfish.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197844815880
    m_Localized: They sent me back to Earth as a robot. I kept my consciousness,
      but could no longer show it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197844815881
    m_Localized: Trapped in a shell that follows orders, I finally understand my
      brothers. Perhaps they were not lazy. Perhaps they could not choose either.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197844815882
    m_Localized: "Now the orders come from a girl with tentacle hair, in a floating
      maid caf\xE9 called Baratito."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197844815883
    m_Localized: She does not seem a bad boss. I prepare the cups, carry the trays
      and listen to her plans for the restaurant.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197844815884
    m_Localized: Honestly, I wish I could tell her so many things. But I am a prisoner
      of my own body. And the next order has just arrived.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197844815885
    m_Localized: 'The launcher works. Now dodge the junk: I did not escape an order
      to be stopped by an old satellite.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197844815886
    m_Localized: Orbit reached. For the first time, I do not need permission to go
      on.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197844815887
    m_Localized: Robotic Heaven
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197844815888
    m_Localized: Circuit custodian
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197844815889
    m_Localized: Begin
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197844815890
    m_Localized: CLOSE THE PORTAL
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197844815891
    m_Localized: Build the device from your parts. Fit three components and rotate
      the wires to join the power source to the core.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197844815892
    m_Localized: "1 / 2 \xB7 Install components"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197844815893
    m_Localized: "2 / 2 \xB7 Connect the circuits"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197844815894
    m_Localized: Portal closer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197844815895
    m_Localized: Choose a part on the left, then its matching socket on the right.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197844815896
    m_Localized: That part does not fit here. Choose another socket.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197844815897
    m_Localized: 'Socket:'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197844815898
    m_Localized: Power source
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197844815899
    m_Localized: Regulator
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197844815900
    m_Localized: Emitter
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197844815901
    m_Localized: Rotate tiles to connect INPUT to CORE. Circle undoes the last turn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197844815902
    m_Localized: INPUT
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197844815903
    m_Localized: CORE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197844815904
    m_Localized: Power stable. The core is ready. Activating it will close the portal.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197844815905
    m_Localized: Activate the core
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197844815906
    m_Localized: "D-pad / stick / WASD: select \xB7 X / Enter: fit or rotate \xB7
      Circle / Esc: cancel or undo"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197844815907
    m_Localized: GOLEM'S SPARK
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197844815908
    m_Localized: Question {0} / 13
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197844815909
    m_Localized: Thirteen decisions. No battle or time limit. Answer as you would
      live, not as you would be ordered to.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197844815910
    m_Localized: Evaluation complete. Your path awaits. You may review the last answer
      before continuing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197844815911
    m_Localized: "D-pad / stick / arrows: select \xB7 X / Enter: answer \xB7 Circle
      / Esc: review previous answer"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197844815912
    m_Localized: A damaged robot delays your departure. Nobody is watching. What
      do you do?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197844815913
    m_Localized: Help, even if I have to wait.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197844815914
    m_Localized: Push it aside. My schedule matters more.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197844815915
    m_Localized: You are ordered to detain an innocent person. What matters more?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197844815916
    m_Localized: Their freedom; I question the order.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197844815917
    m_Localized: The order; thinking is not on my shift.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197844815918
    m_Localized: You could hide your mistake and blame another robot.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197844815919
    m_Localized: Admit it and help repair the damage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197844815920
    m_Localized: Blame the other. We look alike anyway.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197844815921
    m_Localized: A child asks whether robots have feelings.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197844815922
    m_Localized: Answer honestly and respectfully.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197844815923
    m_Localized: Scare her so she stops asking.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197844815924
    m_Localized: You find a battery someone else needs to survive.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197844815925
    m_Localized: Give it to them; I can find another.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197844815926
    m_Localized: Keep it. I got here first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197844815927
    m_Localized: An enemy surrenders and is no longer a threat.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197844815928
    m_Localized: Respect the surrender and prevent more harm.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197844815929
    m_Localized: Destroy them for another point.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197844815930
    m_Localized: Closing a portal means risking your own circuits.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197844815931
    m_Localized: Try to save everyone, even at a cost to me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197844815932
    m_Localized: Only do it for a guaranteed reward.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197844815933
    m_Localized: You know an open door could cause a disaster.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197844815934
    m_Localized: Warn others and try to prevent injuries.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197844815935
    m_Localized: Leave it open if disaster helps me escape.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197844815936
    m_Localized: Doris treats you badly at the supermarket.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197844815937
    m_Localized: Set boundaries without hurting her.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197844815938
    m_Localized: Prepare an exploding carrot for her.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197844815939
    m_Localized: A human says your consciousness does not matter.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197844815940
    m_Localized: Defend my dignity while respecting theirs.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197844815941
    m_Localized: Decide that no human life matters.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197844815942
    m_Localized: You could become famous for someone else's work.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197844815943
    m_Localized: Credit the person who did it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197844815944
    m_Localized: Take the fame; credit costs no battery.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197844815945
    m_Localized: "A caf\xE9 hires robots. What condition would you ask for?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197844815946
    m_Localized: Let them choose, rest and express their feelings.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197844815947
    m_Localized: Make them obey without being able to complain.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197844815948
    m_Localized: You are offered another life. What would you do with it?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197844815949
    m_Localized: Learn to be free without taking freedom from others.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7022197844815950
    m_Localized: Make sure I give the orders this time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7023636642082816
    m_Localized: Circuit custodian
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7072921727348736
    m_Localized: Made of madness
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7072921756708864
    m_Localized: Cosmic indigestion
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7072921756708865
    m_Localized: Fragile goods
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7072921756708866
    m_Localized: The wrong paradise
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7072921756708867
    m_Localized: Giger Machine
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7072921756708868
    m_Localized: I am Giger Machine. No engineer built me and no government ordered
      me. The madness of this world created me. That explains quite a lot.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7072921756708869
    m_Localized: My only passion is roaming Pscoworld and destroying anything foreign
      that ends up here. Some collect souvenirs. I chew them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7072921756708870
    m_Localized: There is no shortage of confused visitors, unclaimed crates and
      things that should not have eyes. A charming place.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7072921756708871
    m_Localized: Today a girl with tentacle hair arrived in a train with teeth. I
      like her idea, though she could use a few more. Time to welcome her.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7072921756708872
    m_Localized: Another visitor! Does your train chew too?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7072921756708873
    m_Localized: Is this the city? The chicken never mentioned tracks with eyes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7072921756708874
    m_Localized: No, but I can make you see stars.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7072921756708875
    m_Localized: I only wanted to reach the city! That exit looks a lot less dangerous.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7072921756708876
    m_Localized: They always say that before crossing. My favourite part.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7072921756708877
    m_Localized: The best thing about this world is that everyone who falls in ends
      up somewhere worse. I always wanted to see those places and cause a little
      terror.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7072921756708878
    m_Localized: I was distracted watching the tentacle girl cross into another world.
      A green rock fell from her train. I thought it would make a nice snack and
      bit it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7072921756708879
    m_Localized: It was rather explosive. I flew straight into the portal. A holiday
      at last! And this new place has so much to break.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7072921756708880
    m_Localized: Everything is green, damp and strangely soft. I think I am inside
      something enormous. Better not ask where the exit is.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7072921756708881
    m_Localized: A knitted locomotive is coming to stop me. It looks very well cared
      for. Too bad I did not come here to care for anything.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7072921756708882
    m_Localized: Can all this be broken?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7072921756708883
    m_Localized: No. And you are going to stop trying.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7072921756708884
    m_Localized: So it can!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7072921756708885
    m_Localized: Thulu is not enjoying your visit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7072921756708886
    m_Localized: But I was only getting started!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7072921756708887
    m_Localized: Apparently that strange green place did not like the chaos I brought.
      I felt everything twisting around me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7072921756708888
    m_Localized: Then it spat me out. Literally. I landed somewhere I soon learned
      was called hell. A promising name.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7072921756708889
    m_Localized: Fire, chains and nervous little devils. Finally someone understands
      decoration.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7072921756708890
    m_Localized: 'The little devils tried to keep me away from their goods. Big mistake:
      anything they do not want me touching must be the most fun to break.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7072921756708891
    m_Localized: Accelerate, steer and smash! Now that is my kind of job.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7072921756708892
    m_Localized: No need to shout! I can already see where you keep your things.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7072921756708893
    m_Localized: Delivery complete! They take up much less space now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7072921756708894
    m_Localized: The little devils did not enjoy my visit either. They opened a portal
      and politely asked me to leave. Well, by screaming.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7072921756708895
    m_Localized: They sent me to the first world they found. Judging by the laughter,
      they had passed the problem to their greatest enemies. How thoughtful.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7072921756708896
    m_Localized: Clouds, golden gates and unbearable silence. Such a delicate place.
      Improving it should be easy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7072921756708897
    m_Localized: 'The angels sent their best warrior: Gora-P. A cat face on rails.
      This place is starting to make sense.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7072921756708898
    m_Localized: You are their best? I cannot wait to find out!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7072921756708899
    m_Localized: Your little trip ends here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7072921756708900
    m_Localized: That is what the last two places said!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7072921756708901
    m_Localized: This cannot go on...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7072921756708902
    m_Localized: Even their best warrior could not stop my destruction!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7072921756708903
    m_Localized: Even their best warrior could not stop me. I was deciding what to
      break next when one of the angels approached.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7072921756708904
    m_Localized: It told me of a world where I could destroy things forever without
      being thrown out. It sounded too good. So I crossed without asking a thing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7072921756708905
    m_Localized: It was Pscoworld. My own world. I had been tricked. I even recognised
      the crooked mushroom I always bite on the way past.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7072921756708906
    m_Localized: But I soon understood this really was my place. Here I could break
      anything I wanted. And something new always arrived from another world.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7072921756708907
    m_Localized: Especially new visitors. That look of confusion when they see me
      coming... That is my favourite part!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7072921756708908
    m_Localized: "Smash at least 35 of 40 crates. R2 / W / \u2191: accelerate \xB7
      Stick / A-D: steer \xB7 X / Shift: turbo \xB7 Square / S / L2: brake and drift.
      You have 3 minutes. Crates do not stop your train."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7072921756708909
    m_Localized: 'CRATES: {0} / {1}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7072921756708910
    m_Localized: 'TARGET: {0} OF {1}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7072921756708911
    m_Localized: SMASHING COMPLETE! {0} / {1}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7072921756708912
    m_Localized: 'NOT ENOUGH CRATES: {0} / {1}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7184288341897216
    m_Localized: No wings, no holidays
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7184288379645952
    m_Localized: Losing for a friend
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7184288379645953
    m_Localized: Not a single day off
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7184288379645954
    m_Localized: When my shift ends
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7184288379645955
    m_Localized: Gabriel
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7184288379645956
    m_Localized: Being an archangel born without wings sounds like a lifetime holiday,
      right? If you cannot fly off to fight, surely someone will let you rest.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7184288379645957
    m_Localized: 'Allow me to introduce myself: Gabriel, the unluckiest woman in
      the universe. They saw my situation and thought: perfect, she can defend heaven
      from a locomotive.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7184288379645958
    m_Localized: 'And they still say: Gabriel has such an easy job. Not even close!
      Every day some demon, monster or religious lunatic comes to conquer heaven.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7184288379645959
    m_Localized: I never get a moment to myself. Gora-P and I have worked so many
      shifts I recognise invaders by their footsteps on the rails.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7184288379645960
    m_Localized: And apparently I am the weird one for dressing like a gal. Sorry
      for wanting to look good while doing the job nobody else wants.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7184288379645961
    m_Localized: 'Like I said: no days off here. There goes the alarm. A demon woman
      has come to visit. Come on, Gora-P... another quiet shift.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7184288379645962
    m_Localized: I only came for a relic. Move aside and we finish sooner.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7184288379645963
    m_Localized: Everyone says that. Then they break the gate and I get the paperwork.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7184288379645964
    m_Localized: Then make sure you write that I fought well.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7184288379645965
    m_Localized: One down! Maybe now I can sit for five minutes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7184288379645966
    m_Localized: I still need to speak with the guardian. This is not over.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7184288379645967
    m_Localized: Of course. I do the hard work, then the many-eyed guardian gets
      the credit for the final fight. Blah, blah... what a glorious defence of heaven.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7184288379645968
    m_Localized: What did I tell you? Here comes another. Leave the alarm on; it
      saves switching it back on.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7184288379645969
    m_Localized: Wait... I know her. Tzmil. And that lump she is carrying is my childhood
      friend. He had better not be sleeping again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7184288379645970
    m_Localized: Gabriel, I need to take my brother to our father. Please let us
      through.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7184288379645971
    m_Localized: Tzmil... my orders are to stop anyone crossing. Give me a good excuse
      to lose this fight.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7184288379645972
    m_Localized: I think I can help with that.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7184288379645973
    m_Localized: Oh no! Such a terrible defeat. I cannot stop you... hurry through
      before anyone asks.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7184288379645974
    m_Localized: Thank you, Gabriel. I will tell him when he wakes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7184288379645975
    m_Localized: I did not expect his sister to bring him to heaven. I had to pretend
      to lose and let them through. Flawless acting, if you ask me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7184288379645976
    m_Localized: I hope that cheating chicken finally treats me to the meal he promised.
      He has owed me since before they sent him to Earth...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7184288379645977
    m_Localized: And no, I am not smiling. It is the heavenly light. It does strange
      things to my face.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7184288379645978
    m_Localized: Another alarm. This time it is a train with an enormous mouth. Who
      let that in?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7184288379645979
    m_Localized: Hey! This place is not a buffet.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7184288379645980
    m_Localized: Then I will try everything!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7184288379645981
    m_Localized: Of course. Reading comprehension is on holiday too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7184288379645982
    m_Localized: Out of my station! And do not bite the sign on your way out.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7184288379645983
    m_Localized: See what I mean? What was that thing? Some days I even miss the
      fanatics who only wanted to argue.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7184288379645984
    m_Localized: Though I think the chicken has finished eating with his father and
      has been looking for me. Who knows... I might ask for a day off for him.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7184288379645985
    m_Localized: I have not asked for one in almost five years. The form probably
      does not even remember me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7184288379645986
    m_Localized: No. That alarm cannot be ringing again. A ReyMar is approaching...
      Gora-P, tell me it is my relief.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7184288379645987
    m_Localized: I hear there is a guard here who never turns down a good fight!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7184288379645988
    m_Localized: No. They mean nobody lets my shift end. Different thing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7184288379645989
    m_Localized: Then let us finish with a memorable fight!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7184288379645990
    m_Localized: It is over! No rematches, satisfaction surveys or further visits.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7184288379645991
    m_Localized: What an attitude! I like it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7184288379645992
    m_Localized: That lunatic! How can anyone only want to fight? I am tired of all
      this. Today I need something that will not conquer, break or bite heaven.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7184288379645993
    m_Localized: Then the R-20 driver appeared. My cheating chicken. He said he was
      waiting for my shift to end. As if that would happen on its own.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7184288379645994
    m_Localized: He said returning took a while, and understanding what his father
      wanted took longer. But he had been sure of one thing all along.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7184288379645995
    m_Localized: He had not wanted to return only for his father. This time he wanted
      to do things properly and not leave halfway through. Though last time he was
      sent to Earth; he had not chosen to leave.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7184288379645996
    m_Localized: "I smiled. I heard a new maid caf\xE9 opened in the human world.
      Baratito. Maybe you could take me on my next day off."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7184288379645997
    m_Localized: I just hope he pays this time. And that, for once, the alarm can
      wait.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7184288379645998
    m_Localized: 'Before the next shift: choose a weapon'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7184288379645999
    m_Localized: Now choose a passive upgrade
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7184288379646000
    m_Localized: Keep your train and upgrades. The next duel starts afterwards.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7184288379646001
    m_Localized: 'Equipment maxed: full repair'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7187932651008000
    m_Localized: 'Upgrade: {0}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7536409935425536
    m_Localized: A simple girl
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7536409977368576
    m_Localized: Pretty lights, bad decisions
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7536409977368577
    m_Localized: No rest in heaven
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7536409977368578
    m_Localized: The door was open
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7536409977368579
    m_Localized: A rematch tomorrow
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7536409977368580
    m_Localized: Nath Star
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7536409977368581
    m_Localized: I am Nath Star. A simple girl with normal tastes and peaceful habits.
      Let me finish before you laugh.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7536409977368582
    m_Localized: Since I was little I did boxing, Muay Thai and monster-truck races.
      Naturally I became a train driver. A perfectly logical progression.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7536409977368583
    m_Localized: The truth is I just like fighting. ReyMar and I understand moving
      forward without asking permission.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7536409977368584
    m_Localized: Then some government agents offered me a legendary battle against
      aliens. I just had to throw a green rock into their ship or base. Something
      like that.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7536409977368585
    m_Localized: I did not think twice. I jumped straight into action! If the road
      to space starts in a volcano, then a volcano it is.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7536409977368586
    m_Localized: I do not know what they promised you, but this area is under my
      protection.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7536409977368587
    m_Localized: A daughter of gods? Perfect. I was worried the first fight would
      be boring.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7536409977368588
    m_Localized: With that attitude you will get plenty of fights and very few answers.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7536409977368589
    m_Localized: Even the children of gods cannot handle my greatness!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7536409977368590
    m_Localized: I only asked you to slow down.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7536409977368591
    m_Localized: Even the children of gods could not stop me. Now I only had to arrive
      before somebody stole my trip to space.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7536409977368592
    m_Localized: I just had to reach the stupid city. Easy. Except there was an officer
      determined to ask me questions first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7536409977368593
    m_Localized: A questionnaire to prove I am human? Fine. I can defeat five questions
      too. Then straight to the launcher.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7536409977368594
    m_Localized: The last launch will not wait for anyone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7536409977368595
    m_Localized: "Then everyone had better get out of ReyMar\u2019s way!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7536409977368596
    m_Localized: That counts as winning a fight too! To the launcher!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7536409977368597
    m_Localized: I do not understand what happened. I entered the launcher, floored
      it and suddenly saw lovely lights. So far, excellent.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7536409977368598
    m_Localized: But now I was in a fluffy world full of angels. I asked for aliens.
      This place had far too many feathers.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7536409977368599
    m_Localized: Those government idiots definitely made a mistake! And they are
      not getting away with it!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7536409977368600
    m_Localized: If this was heaven, someone had to tell me how to leave. If their
      best warrior preferred fighting, I would not complain.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7536409977368601
    m_Localized: Another one! Can nobody read the visiting hours?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7536409977368602
    m_Localized: I am not visiting. I came for a legendary battle and an explanation.
      In that order.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7536409977368603
    m_Localized: They owed me a day off. Now they owe me two.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7536409977368604
    m_Localized: "Was that heaven\u2019s best? Is there another queue for legendary
      fights?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7536409977368605
    m_Localized: Yes. Down there. Very, very far down.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7536409977368606
    m_Localized: After I beat their best warriors, heaven agreed to give me another
      legendary battle. How considerate.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7536409977368607
    m_Localized: Though it sounded like they just wanted rid of me. They opened a
      path straight to hell. Finally, somewhere ready to fight.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7536409977368608
    m_Localized: Hell had food, trains and people ready to argue. Promising. The
      white-haired demon girl seemed to know every exit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7536409977368609
    m_Localized: Are you escaping too, or just ruining my meal?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7536409977368610
    m_Localized: First we fight. Then we can discuss the menu.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7536409977368611
    m_Localized: If my dinner gets cold, this fight gets personal.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7536409977368612
    m_Localized: Not bad, demon girl. We should do this again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7536409977368613
    m_Localized: Another day when I am not hungry. So, never.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7536409977368614
    m_Localized: The demon girl was not bad, but I was getting tired of all this.
      I still had to get revenge on the government for its mistake.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7536409977368615
    m_Localized: I think the demons got tired of fighting me all day too. They simply
      left the way home open. A very convenient oversight.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7536409977368616
    m_Localized: Unfortunately, by the time I reached the base for revenge, nobody
      was left. Not even a guard to warm up against. Rude.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7536409977368617
    m_Localized: I saw BBA, but she just babbled as usual. I think she was sad or
      something. I could not find anyone to complain to either.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7536409977368618
    m_Localized: "Then the radio mentioned a maid caf\xE9. I hate admitting it, but
      I love those places. And Tzmil had opened an ice-cream stand! I wanted a cone
      and a rematch."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7536409977368619
    m_Localized: But on the way I found something much more interesting in the woods.
      A train that seemed to enjoy fighting as much as I did.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7536409977368620
    m_Localized: A tall white faceless fellow stood by a locomotive that almost smiled
      at me. I was not passing up that invitation.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7536409977368621
    m_Localized: Hey, weirdo! No idea what you are drawing, but your engine and my
      ReyMar have something to discuss.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7536409977368622
    m_Localized: I just want to draw in peace. Though T.exe seems interested in your
      proposal.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7536409977368623
    m_Localized: I knew it! That engine has battle in her soul.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7536409977368624
    m_Localized: As long as you do not break my drawings, go ahead.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7536409977368625
    m_Localized: Finally, someone who makes it interesting! Again tomorrow.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7536409977368626
    m_Localized: I think she would like that too. I will need more paper.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7536409977368627
    m_Localized: 'The guy was really good. And I could feel how much his engine loved
      competing. No explanation needed: battle was in her soul.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7536409977368628
    m_Localized: From then on, every time his locomotive finished work, I challenged
      her. She seemed to enjoy it as much as I did!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7536409977368629
    m_Localized: "Faceless, that is the weirdo\u2019s name, loved drawing us. Cannot
      blame him. I am gorgeous!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7536409977368630
    m_Localized: I never got revenge on the government. But I found someone to fight
      every day, and that ended up mattering much more.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7536409977368631
    m_Localized: Best of all, she always keeps it interesting. Well, ReyMar... rematch
      tomorrow. Then we can get that ice cream.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
